    "detailed_description": "Defender of Children ... and the Innocent<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDOC ATI is an arcade type game created as a reaction to disturbing trends in the gaming world involving childlike imagery in sexual situations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have a problem with the sexual content in games when the sex objects have child-like features? Sometimes the front page or other less explicit images will display more childlike faces or other features; then later images will show a more mature body or other features. Sneaky like the devil.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you sick and tired of just having to put up with it with no voice?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo more! Jump in your spaceship and let off a little steam and defend the innocent!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nResist! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRage against the latrine!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRefuse to go silently into a future in which children are targeted. Take the attacks on yourself; you will be shielding kids from harm.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cI sought for a man among them who would build up the wall and stand in the gap before me for the land, that I would not destroy it; but I found no one.&quot;           <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Creator of the universe",
